UID:athx-20261109-mon-cf@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261109T063000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261109T073000
SUMMARY:🏋️‍♂️ CrossFit (Session 1) - Upper & Pull Focus
DESCRIPTION:CrossFit Box WOD\n• Focus: Metabolic conditioning, gymnastics & upper-body pulling.\n• DIRECTIVE: Save quads and Achilles for Wednesday's HERO WOD 'CHAD 1000X'. Avoid heavy box jumps, heavy wall balls, or sprint lunges.
LOCATION:CrossFit Box
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:athx-20261110-tue-core@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261110T063000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261110T071500
SUMMARY:🧘 ATHX Priming, Core & Push-Up Activation (Zero Barbell Load)
DESCRIPTION:Pre-CHAD Autonomic Priming, Trunk Stability & Scapular Push Activation\n• Movement prep: Ankle dorsiflexion, hip flexor openers, glute activation\n• Core & Push: Pallof press, Deadbug, Side plank, Hollow hold + Scapular Push-Up Plus (3 rounds: 3×10–12 reps)\n• DIRECTIVE: ZERO barbell or leg loading. Protecting knees for Wednesday's 1,000 box step-ups and keeping ACWR ≤1.48.
LOCATION:Gym / Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:athx-20261110-tue-run1@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261110T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261110T191500
SUMMARY:🏃 ATHX Run 1: Light Zone 2 Aerobic Flush
DESCRIPTION:Distance: 4.0–5.0 km @ 5:50–6:15/km\n• Heart Rate: Strictly Zone 2 (<130 bpm)\n• Purpose: Low-impact aerobic circulation to flush legs before CHAD.\n• DIRECTIVE: If heart rate exceeds 130 bpm, drop pace. Do not race.
LOCATION:Road / Flat Track
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:athx-20261111-wed-chad@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261111T063000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261111T074500
SUMMARY:🎖️ HERO WOD: CHAD 1000X
DESCRIPTION:HERO WOD 'CHAD 1000X'\n• Work: 1,000 Box Step-ups onto 20" Box (weighted vest/ruck if scaled/prescribed)\n• Target Time: 48–60 minutes steady pace\n• Strategy: Lock in 20 reps/min (3s per step). Alternate lead leg every 10–20 reps to prevent calf cramping. Full hip lockout at top of box.
LOCATION:CrossFit Box
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:athx-20261111-wed-recovery@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261111T183000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261111T190000
SUMMARY:🚫 PM RUN CANCELLED: Active Recovery & Elevation
DESCRIPTION:EVENING RUN CANCELLED\n• Purpose: Mitigate eccentric muscle damage from 1,000 box step-ups.\n• Protocol: Legs elevated 15–20 min, hydrate with electrolytes, targeted quad/glute foam rolling. Target 8.5h sleep opportunity.
LOCATION:Home / Recovery Suite
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:athx-20261112-thu-upper@athx2027.internal
DTSTAMP:20261109T144653Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261109T144653Z
SEQUENCE:2
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261112T063000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Paris:20261112T072500
SUMMARY:🏋️ ATHX Gym B: Upper Power & S2O Overhead
DESCRIPTION:1. Shoulder-to-Overhead (S2O Push Press): 4×5 @ 45–50 kg\n2. Barbell Bench Press: 3×6–8 @ 75–80 kg\n3. Weighted Pull-ups: 3×6–8 (+10 to +15 kg)\n4. Dumbbell Scapular & Face Pulls: 3×12–15\n• Optional: 20 min Zone 1 spin on BikeErg (<115 bpm) for quad drainage.\n• DIRECTIVE: Quads in peak DOMS post-CHAD. Zero lower-body axial loading. Hits upper ATHX power benchmarks cleanly.
LOCATION:Gym / Strength Facility
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
